        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-5633, 5-1/2 Inch Oval Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Flush Pull made by RK International measures 5-1/2 inches long and 1-5/8 inches wide. Its elegant style is only heightened by the 7 available finishes which include polished brass and the very popular satin nickel. The oval shape lends this pocket door pull a traditional air, making it a great choice for anyone with classic tastes.  Easily installs with just two brad nails.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-5633 Thick Oval Flush Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height:  5-1/2\" (140 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width:  1-5/8\" (41mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth:  9/16\" (14 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth 7/16\" (11.5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height:  4-3/8\" (111 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width:  7/8\" (21.5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Height:  4-7/8\" (123.5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width:  1-1/8\" (29 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oil-bronze-crab.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
